s might lead to increased savings and reduced consumption. Attractive deposit rates can enhance the soundness of financial institutions by increasing their deposit base, and liquidity which is crucial for their lending activities.^Deposit rates are typically set with changes in repo rates which are aligned for inflation. Higher rates compensate for higher inflation, maintaining the real return on deposits.^Changes in central bank policy rates are reflected in term deposit rates, indicating the effectiveness of monetary policy transmission."}],"related":[{"slug":"aggregate-bank-deposits","title":"Aggregate Bank Deposits"},{"slug":"bank-credit-industry","title":"Bank Credit - Industry"},{"slug":"bank-credit-personal-loans","title":"Bank Credit - Personal Loans"},{"slug":"bank-credit-services","title":"Bank Credit - Services"},{"slug":"cash-reserve-ratio-crr","title":"Cash Reserve Ratio (CRR)"},{"slug":"credit-deposit-ratio","title":"Credit-Deposit Ratio"},{"slug":"foreign-exchange-reserves","title":"Foreign Exchange Reserves"},{"slug":"foreign-portfolio-investments-fpis-debt","title":"Foreign Portfolio Investments (FPIs) - Debt"},{"slug":"marginal-cost-of-funds-based-lending-rates-mclr","title":"Marginal Cost of Funds based Lending Rates (MCLR)"},{"slug":"money-supply-m3","title":"Money Supply (M3)"},{"slug":"nifty-bank-pe-ratio","title":"NIFTY Bank P/E Ratio"},{"slug":"rbi-liquidity-net-laf","title":"RBI Liquidity (Net LAF)"},{"slug":"repo-rate","title":"Repo Rate"},{"slug":"statutory-liquidity-ratio-slr","title":"Statutory Liquidity Ratio (SLR)"},{"slug":"weighted-average-lending-rate-on-fresh-rupee-loans-walr","title":"Weighted Average Lending Rate on Fresh Rupee Loans (WALR)"}],"title":"Term Deposit Rate","description":"The Term Deposit Rates data represents the interest rates offered by banks on fixed-term deposits.","headline":{},"source":"CMIE Economic Outlook, 1 Finance Research","source_url":"https://economicoutlook.cmie.com/","date_modified":"2026-10-11","sc